(a)
defining any word or expression used in but not defined in this Act;

(b)
respecting the form, the nature, the technological attributes or any other characteristic of the electronic information that may or shall be used for the purpose of any provision of this Act or in relation to any matter;

(c)
respecting the manner in which and the terms and conditions on which electronic information referred to in paragraph (b) may or shall be used;

(d)
respecting consent to electronic transactions and the manner in which consent is given and expressed;

(e)
respecting electronic payments;

(f)
excluding any Act, legal requirement, information, transaction or other matter from the application of this Act or of any of its provisions;

